OL,3,GNEWSACoroner probes deaths of men under
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis article references suicide and
OL,7,Fcontains details some readers may find
OL,8,Fupsetting. If you, or someone you know,
OL,9,Fis struggling with the issues raised in
OL,10,Fthis article, support and information
OL,11,Fis available at BBC Action Line.
OL,13,FThe apparent suicides of five men who
OL,14,Fwere under police investigation at the
OL,15,Ftime of their deaths are being probed
OL,16,Fby a coroner.
OL,18,FRobert Cohen is hearing the inquests of
OL,19,Ffive men who died in Cumbria in the
OL,20,Fspace of eight months while on bail for
OL,21,Falleged offences.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
