OL,3,GNEWSACoroner probes deaths of men under
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile their deaths are not linked, the
OL,7,Fcoroner said there was a "common
OL,8,Fthread" in that all men "appear to have
OL,9,Fended their own life at the time when
OL,10,Fthey were being investigated by
OL,11,Fpolice".
